  "estimatedMinutes": 2,
  "statement": "The sum of all real \\(x\\) such that \\[ \\begin{aligned} &(2^x-4)^3+(4^x-2)^3\\\\ &\\qquad=(4^x+2^x-6)^3 \\end{aligned} \\] is",
  "answerChoices": [
